{"3300570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Till the End", "steam_appid": 3300570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-time purchase • DRM-free • No microtransactions<br><br>FAST PACED AND PUNISHING! SURVIVE TILL THE END.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo-developed by one person.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Combat &amp; Power Suits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use 3 unique Power Suits: Bushido the deadly sword master, Centurion the ballistics expert, and Magi the ki-blast caster. Combine them with a wide variety of weapons to survive intense enemy waves, mini-bosses, and massive boss fights.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/e561bb3ae569d62a0bf704623ceee0bb.poster.avif?t=1785894948\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/e561bb3ae569d62a0bf704623ceee0bb.webm?t=1785894948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/e561bb3ae569d62a0bf704623ceee0bb.mp4?t=1785894948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Recruit &amp; Unlock Playable Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions for shopkeepers to recruit survivors as playable characters. Each one brings their own personality, backstory, and unique Power Suit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open Sandbox City</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large ruined city. Shops are scattered throughout. Visit them anytime to spend resources and accept new missions. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/628dfc9d8ee97751b3b7bd4382ce37f2.poster.avif?t=1785894948\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/628dfc9d8ee97751b3b7bd4382ce37f2.webm?t=1785894948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/628dfc9d8ee97751b3b7bd4382ce37f2.mp4?t=1785894948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Progression</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up each character individually with XP Data Banks and permanent upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/fdd77d031b89c41eff92d2eae521d98e.poster.avif?t=1785894948\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/fdd77d031b89c41eff92d2eae521d98e.webm?t=1785894948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/fdd77d031b89c41eff92d2eae521d98e.mp4?t=1785894948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;If you're out there…we need you.  Let's take back our home.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One-time purchase • DRM-free • No microtransactions<br><br>FAST PACED AND PUNISHING! SURVIVE TILL THE END.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo-developed by one person.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brutal Combat &amp; Power Suits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use 3 unique Power Suits: Bushido the deadly sword master, Centurion the ballistics expert, and Magi the ki-blast caster. Combine them with a wide variety of weapons to survive intense enemy waves, mini-bosses, and massive boss fights.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/e561bb3ae569d62a0bf704623ceee0bb.poster.avif?t=1785894948\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/e561bb3ae569d62a0bf704623ceee0bb.webm?t=1785894948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/e561bb3ae569d62a0bf704623ceee0bb.mp4?t=1785894948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Recruit &amp; Unlock Playable Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions for shopkeepers to recruit survivors as playable characters. Each one brings their own personality, backstory, and unique Power Suit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open Sandbox City</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large ruined city. Shops are scattered throughout. Visit them anytime to spend resources and accept new missions. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/628dfc9d8ee97751b3b7bd4382ce37f2.poster.avif?t=1785894948\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/628dfc9d8ee97751b3b7bd4382ce37f2.webm?t=1785894948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/628dfc9d8ee97751b3b7bd4382ce37f2.mp4?t=1785894948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Progression</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up each character individually with XP Data Banks and permanent upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/fdd77d031b89c41eff92d2eae521d98e.poster.avif?t=1785894948\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/fdd77d031b89c41eff92d2eae521d98e.webm?t=1785894948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3300570/extras/fdd77d031b89c41eff92d2eae521d98e.mp4?t=1785894948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot;If you're out there…we need you.  Let's take back our home.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Earth has fallen. Recruit survivors in the ruins, activate their unique Power Suits, and fight back against endless alien hordes in this solo-developed sci-fi roguelite wave shooter. Master Bushido blades, Centurion tanks, or Magi blasts — become unstoppable.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Malay, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese